   "title": "Sewer mains",
   "description": "<div><p>This dataset consists of sewer mains. The types of mains (Sanitary, Storm, Combined, Sanitary Force) are distinguished by attributes. </p><p>Related datasets include: </p><ul><li><p>GVRD (Metro Vancouver) trunk\u00a0</p></li><li>\u200bSewers\u00a0manholes\u200b<br></li><li>Sewer catch basins</li></ul><p>Commercial and residential connections to the mains are not available. </p></div><p><h3>Data currency</h3></p><div><p>This data is updated frequently in the normal course of business, however priorities and resources determine how fast a change in reality is reflected in the database. The extract of this data on this website is updated weekly.</p></div><p><h3>Data accuracy</h3></p><div><p>Sewer features are generally created with survey accuracy.</p></div>",
